# KTLX UI conventions

Apply these rules whenever adding or editing UI or copy in this repo.

## Brand & tokens

- Always use CSS variables from `src/styles/tokens.css` (`--ktlx-*`). Do not introduce purple gradients, cream paper themes, or default Inter/Roboto stacks.
- Background atmosphere: deep teal/forest (`--ktlx-bg`, `--ktlx-surface`) with seafoam/cyan accents (`--ktlx-accent`, `--ktlx-accent-soft`).
- Lime (`--ktlx-lime`) only for rare positive highlights, not primary CTAs.
- Logo lockup: larger logo + `KTLX` ticker on one row, title **Kaspa Token Launches X** below, socials (Discord + X) under that, banner above nav.
- Connect button stays top-right.

## Layout

- Shell: left sidebar + main column (`AppShell`). New pages render inside `<Outlet />`.
- Prefer simple page header (`h1` + one muted sentence) then primary cards/panels.
- Cards use `.card` / `.card-interactive` with border highlight on hover.
- Global toasts: `useToast()` bottom-right, dismiss with X.
- Shortened addresses/txs: always `CopyableShort` with copy control.

## Copy bans (hard rule)

- Never use the em dash character `—` anywhere in the project (UI, README, comments, meta). Use a hyphen `-`, period, or rephrase.
- Never use the word `blockchain` anywhere in the project. Prefer Kaspa L1, on-chain, network, or similar.

## Components

- Reuse `.btn`, `.btn-primary`, `.btn-ghost`, `.card`, `.field`, `.modal` from `src/styles/app.css`.
- Keep inputs, selects, textareas on the unified control styles.
- Wallet: only Kasware via `useWallet` / `src/lib/kaspa/kasware.ts`.
- Payments: use `PayPanel` / `PayModal`.

## Product boundaries

- No Kasparex branding, names, env keys, or cross-links.
- Client-only: no server secrets; public `VITE_*` config only. Admin = ownership of `VITE_ADMIN_ADDRESS`.
